--- !u!114 &1769538077163388050
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dcc7c4643be973949ae6ee7ba56548ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: 50bef972-08ee-49cc-a2f0-c479e773dddb
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  characterSpeaking: 0
  text: "O macaquinho ficou por muito tempo morando na Lua, mas um dia come\xE7ou
    a sentir saudades da Terra, de seus amigos e da natureza. Ele ent\xE3o pediu
    \xE0 sua amiga que o ajudasse a retornar para sua casa."
  children:
  - c9c61a9e-8149-4a74-a23c-995ec28be361
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 1403
    y: -3
    width: 200
    height: 100
  onEnterAction: 
  onExitAction: 
--- !u!114 &2851290946261837827
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dcc7c4643be973949ae6ee7ba56548ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: 21b0f567-e8ee-4d0f-8986-e62fa1d0b2c4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  characterSpeaking: 0
  text: "O grupo de macacos colocou o plano em a\xE7\xE3o e o macaquinho menor foi
    o \xFAltimo a subir, conseguindo chegar ao c\xE9u e agarrando-se \xE0 Lua. "
  children:
  - 45bb5b36-d31a-42c9-b6a7-067498f83a20
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 802
    y: -1
    width: 200
    height: 100
  onEnterAction: 
  onExitAction: 
--- !u!114 &5508499712109032126
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dcc7c4643be973949ae6ee7ba56548ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: 1a1a589e-2e55-4a7d-be18-f5e31b8c4c21
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  characterSpeaking: 0
  text: "O macaco concordou. Ele sentou em seu tambor e foi amarrado a uma corda,
    que come\xE7ou o processo de descida. Enquanto descia, o macaquinho olhava seu
    tambor e surgiu uma vontade irresist\xEDvel de toc\xE1-lo."
  children:
  - 1a4926b3-8330-4a91-85cf-aaa643449b1b
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2201
    y: -4
    width: 200
    height: 100
  onEnterAction: 
  onExitAction: 
--- !u!114 &5639613196388190454
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dcc7c4643be973949ae6ee7ba56548ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: c9c61a9e-8149-4a74-a23c-995ec28be361
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  characterSpeaking: 2
  text: "Mas por que voc\xEA quer voltar? N\xE3o est\xE1 feliz aqui com o tamborzinho
    que eu te dei?"
  children:
  - c596f118-9316-4cbc-a06b-0109edde151d
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 1603
    y: -3
    width: 200
    height: 100
  onEnterAction: 
  onExitAction: 
--- !u!114 &6693853242856715486
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dcc7c4643be973949ae6ee7ba56548ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: 934fe754-0aca-4241-ab8e-cff7f0b16e4e
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  characterSpeaking: 3
  text: "Menina, isso \xE9 um tambor. Por favor, entregue ao povo de seu pa\xEDs."
  children:
  - 5fb293c0-0874-4f26-bfb7-ec742042900b
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 3008
    y: 0
    width: 200
